  "title": "Cognition-Aligned Reasoning Distillation (CARD)",
  "summary": "CARD transforms solver trajectories into teaching trajectories aligned with the student's cognition, improving reasoning models by learning token-level discrepancies between a stronger teacher and an on-policy student. This approach reduces the need for expensive resampling and addresses the mismatch between teacher and student reasoning capabilities.",
